'''Emerald''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading. 

==Appearance==
Its blade and guard are green and black in color, resembling the appearance of emerald, hence the name. The handle is solid black.

==Trivia== 
*Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/175664893/SKIN-Forest-Knife texture] was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/14188665/profile Donut_Steel], and was uploaded to Roblox on September 13, 2014.
*Players can exchange 12 rare [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain this by chance.

